== Effects ==
* Upon entering a room with enemies, spawns a [[Familiars#Locusts|Black Locust]] that deals quadruple Isaac's damage, applied as two hits of double damage.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r+}} This trinket has a 1% chance to drop when defeating {{e|Death}}.{{dlc-}}
* The Locust will also spawn each time a wave starts in {{R|Boss Rush}} and {{dlc|r+}} {{mode|greed|greedier}} [[Greed Mode]].
* If the player has exited the game, the Locust will spawn upon continuing from the main menu, allowing multiple locusts to spawn for the same room by repeatedly exiting.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Each copy will spawn one more locust.

